@Gateway = http://localhost:5000
@Email = gateway-demo@ainvest.dev
@Password = GatewayDemo!2026

### 1) Register through the gateway (anonymous route); run once, later use 2) login
POST {{Gateway}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{Email}}", "password": "{{Password}}" }

### 2) Login through the gateway (rate limited: 5 per minute per IP, the 6th gets 429)
# @name login
POST {{Gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{Email}}", "password": "{{Password}}" }

###
# the token comes from the login response above. The user id is the token's "sub":
# paste the access token into jwt.io (or decode the middle part) and copy "sub" here
@Token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@UserId = paste-sub-from-the-token-here

### 3) Save own profile (sameUser policy: the {userId} must be the token's sub)
PUT {{Gateway}}/api/Profiles/{{UserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "monthlyIncome": 30000,
  "monthlyExpenses": 25000,
  "monthlyDebtPayment": 7000,
  "totalDebt": 90000,
  "cashReserve": 3000,
  "investmentAmount": 10000,
  "riskPreference": "HIGH",
  "impatienceLevel": 5
}

### 4) Calculate IQ: gateway -> Finance -> (Polly) -> IQ -> usp_SaveIqResult
POST {{Gateway}}/api/Profiles/{{UserId}}/calculate-iq
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 5) Score history (fn_IqTrend: LAG, moving average)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/financial-iq/{{UserId}}/history?take=12
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 6) Someone else's profile with my token -> 403 (BOLA protection)
GET {{Gateway}}/api/Profiles/demo-user-1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### 7) No token -> 401
GET {{Gateway}}/api/Profiles/{{UserId}}

### 8) Listing every profile is not routed -> 404
GET {{Gateway}}/api/Profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
